IND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm not being dramatic."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":589},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-33"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I'm stepping away before I say something I regret."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":590},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-34"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: We're all upset."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":591},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-35"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That's not the point."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":592},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-36"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Then what is?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":593},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-37"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: The point is that none of us knows who we're supposed to trust right now."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":594},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-10-39"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: And apparently I'm the only one willing to admit it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":595},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C11-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Good."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":596},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C11-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Because I don't."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":597},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C11-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Nobody's asking you to."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":598},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C11-a-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then we're clear."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":599},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-11-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Sophie."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":600},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-11-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Yeah?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}