 we need to talk about this."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":614},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-11-26"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":615},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-11-28"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Later, then."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":616},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-11-31"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: ..."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":617},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-11-32"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Well."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":618},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-11-33"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: That went brilliantly."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":619},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C12-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":620},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C12-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: You didn't."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":621},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C12-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: This started long before you joined."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":622},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-C12-a-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I'm sorry you had to see it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":623},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-12-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Listen."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":624},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-12-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I think I owe you an explanation."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":625},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-12-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: But I'd rather not have this conversation in front of everyone."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":false}}],"id":626},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-AFTER-12-6"}},{"k":"text